---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';

const effectiveDate = "August 28, 2026";
const lastUpdated = "August 28, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — RBT Practice Exam"
  description="Terms & Conditions for using the free RBT examination prep resources, practice tests, and study materials on rbtpracticeexam.xyz."
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 space-y-8 animate-fadeIn text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    
    {/* Page Header */}
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>Terms of Use</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        <span><strong>Effective Date:</strong> {effectiveDate}</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span><strong>Last Updated:</strong> {lastUpdated}</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span><strong>Website:</strong> <code>https://rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code></span>
      </div>
    </header>

    {/* Notice & Disclaimer Box */}
    <section class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-900/60 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-1.5">
      <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 uppercase tracking-wide text-xs">
        <span>Independent Educational Resource Notice</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <strong>RBT Practice Exam</strong> (<code>https://rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code>) is an independently operated educational study website. We are <strong>not</strong> affiliated with, sponsored by, approved by, or endorsed by the <strong>Behavior Analyst Certification Board (BACB)</strong>. RBT and BACB are registered trademarks used solely to describe the subject matter of our study resources.
      </p>
    </section>

    {/* Terms Sections */}
    <article class="space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">

      {/* 1. Acceptance of Terms */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          1. Acceptance of These Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using <strong>RBT Practice Exam</strong> (referred to as "the website," "we," "our," or "us"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you should discontinue using the website immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 2. Educational Purpose & No Guarantees */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          2. Educational Purpose & No Results Guarantee
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website provides educational materials, practice questions, mock exam simulations, flashcards, and study guides designed to assist users in preparing for examination topics.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>No Passing or Success Guarantee:</strong> Using this website does not guarantee that you will pass any examination, achieve a specific score, gain certification, be admitted to an exam, or secure employment. Examination success depends on many personal factors, including comprehensive study, official coursework, and individual preparation.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 3. Independent Resource */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          3. Independent Operation
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website is independently created and maintained. It is not the official website of the BACB or any testing authority. We do not represent any official credentialing body.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 4. Accuracy of Information */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          4. Accuracy of Educational Content
        </h2>
        <p>
          We make reasonable efforts to keep our study materials clear, helpful, and accurate. However, educational materials may occasionally contain mistakes, and official certification requirements or task lists may change over time.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not promise that all questions, explanations, or articles are completely error-free. Users are strongly encouraged to verify important requirements with official certification handbooks and authorized course providers.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 5. Practice Questions Notice */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          5. Practice Questions & Mock Exams
        </h2>
        <p>
          The practice questions and mock exams on this website are original study simulations created for learning and self-assessment. They are <strong>not actual, live examination questions</strong>, and we make no claim that specific questions from this website will appear on any official examination.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 6. AI-Assisted Study Features */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          6. Artificial Intelligence Study Assistance
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our website includes an <strong>AI Study Tutor</strong> that provides automated explanations and learning rationales.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li>AI-generated answers are provided for supplementary learning and quick reference.</li>
          <li>Artificial intelligence can make mistakes or provide incomplete explanations.</li>
          <li>The AI Tutor is not a human instructor, official supervisor, or representative of any certification organization.</li>
          <li>You should always apply your own judgment and confirm important concepts with authoritative textbooks.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 7. User Responsibilities */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          7. User Responsibilities
        </h2>
        <p>
          As a user of this website, you are responsible for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li>How you choose to use the study materials.</li>
          <li>Verifying official exam rules, eligibility criteria, and deadlines with the appropriate certification board.</li>
          <li>Making your own decisions regarding your examination preparation strategy.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 8. Acceptable Use */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          8. Acceptable Use
        </h2>
        <p>
          When using our website, you agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li>Use the website for any unlawful, deceptive, or harmful purpose.</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, damage, or overload the website.</li>
          <li>Interfere with another person’s ability to use the study materials.</li>
          <li>Copy, scrape, resell, republish, or distribute our study questions and guides in bulk without permission.</li>
          <li>Falsely claim that our materials were created by you or another organization.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 9. Content Ownership */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          9. Ownership of Content
        </h2>
        <p>
          The original questions, explanations, flashcards, study guides, articles, website design, and written materials on this website belong to <strong>RBT Practice Exam</strong> or its content contributors, unless otherwise stated.
        </p>
        <p>
          You are granted a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable right to view and use the study materials for your own personal educational preparation. You may not sell, package, or republish our materials commercially without written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 10. Third-Party Links */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          10. Links to Other Websites
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our website may occasionally link to external websites for additional reading or official references. These external sites are operated independently, and we are not responsible for their content, policies, or availability.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 11. Website Availability */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          11. Website Availability & Maintenance
        </h2>
        <p>
          We aim to keep this website accessible at all times. However, uninterrupted availability cannot be guaranteed. The website may occasionally be temporarily unavailable due to scheduled updates, routine maintenance, or circumstances beyond our control.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 12. Changes to Content & Features */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          12. Changes to Content & Features
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to update, add, modify, or remove study questions, exam simulations, or features at any time to improve the platform or correct mistakes, without prior notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 13. Changes to These Terms */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          13. Updates to These Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms & Conditions from time to time. When updates occur, the revised version will be published on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. Continuing to use the website after changes are posted means you accept the updated Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 14. Disclaimers */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          14. General Disclaimers
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website and its study materials are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis for educational and informational purposes only. We make no express or implied warranties regarding the completeness, reliability, or fitness for a particular purpose of any material on this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 15. Limitation of Liability */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          15. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, RBT Practice Exam and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential losses or damages arising from:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li>Your use of or inability to use the website.</li>
          <li>Your reliance on study materials, practice questions, or AI explanations.</li>
          <li>Any errors, omissions, or inaccuracies in the content.</li>
          <li>Changes to examination requirements or certification rules.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 16. No Professional Advice */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          16. No Professional or Clinical Advice
        </h2>
        <p>
          The materials on this website are strictly for educational preparation. They do not constitute formal clinical supervision, professional behavior analytic consultation, legal advice, or employment counseling.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 17. Privacy Policy Reference */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          17. Privacy & Data Handling
        </h2>
        <p>
          Your privacy is important to us. Please review our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-bold underline">Privacy Policy</a> to understand how your local study progress is kept privately on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 18. Age Limitations */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          18. Age Limitations
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website is designed for adults and students preparing for professional career examinations. It is not intended for use by children under the age of 13.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 19. Restriction of Access */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          19. Restriction of Access
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to restrict or block access to the website for any individual or automated system that abuses our study resources, disrupts the site, or violates these Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 20. Governing Law */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          20. Governing Law
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms & Conditions shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with applicable laws:
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          <code>[INSERT GOVERNING LAW / JURISDICTION]</code> *(Site Owner: Confirm your preferred country or state jurisdiction prior to final formal registration).*
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* 21. Contact Information */}
      <section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          21. Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or feedback regarding these Terms & Conditions, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 text-sm space-y-1">
          <div><strong>Website:</strong> <code>https://rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code></div>
          <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-bold underline">support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
